  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 18 June 2025, the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 16 June 2025 and numbered 450/PCIL/SU -100, 450/PCIL/SU -101, 450/PCIL/SU -102, 450/PCIL/IF -110 Rev. IF, 450/PCIL/IF -111 Rev. IF, 450/PCIL/IF -112 Rev. IF was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. \r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class A, Clause (f)(i) of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the proposed single storey rear extension would extend beyond the rear wall of the original dwellinghouse by more than 3 metres.\r\n"
